in CLI transcripts, plus OpenCode sessions herdr identifies, Linux Grok sessions and experimental…","Approve with a tap — supported approvals, questions and plan menus become cards, checked to be current before your answer is sent. Use Terminal for requests without card support.","Know when you're needed — live status for every pane, an alert that drops in while the app is open, and push alerts when an agent needs input or finishes, even with the app closed.","Speak instead of typing — dictate into the chat or the terminal line, Korean and English mixed. Review the words before sending them to the agent; transcription uses your own OpenAI key or the browser's speech…","Review repository changes — open working-tree, staged or commit comparisons from the file browser and read each file's diff without changing the repository."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devswha/herdr-web-ui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a34f95065e79f1b1d98dfe97ab971a582665d56d20cf93329754ab87b555672f","extractedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:14.949Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:14.949Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"website · install · try the demo · quick start · faq · docs","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devswha/herdr-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Without a configured token, your devices normally get in without a code when tailscale serve reports the same login as this PC's owner.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devswha/herdr-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"If your own phone is asked to pair anyway, HERDRWEBTAILSCALESERVEONLY=1 allows the no-login path only when Tailscale confirms one login owns the tailnet with no tagged nodes, and serve is the sole route to this port.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devswha/herdr-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a34f95065e79f1b1d98dfe97ab971a582665d56d20cf93329754ab87b555672f","sourceUrl":"https://